{
  "id": "1379",
  "title": "No Heating?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2022-02-12",
  "synopsis": "The heating in Ben’s apartment isn’t working.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1379/2f80194bb1402e968b58293a34fcfd48043bf879.mp3?1636463502",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "没有暖气？\n\n物业：喂，您好！这里是物业，有什么可以帮您吗？\n本：您好，我是住在802的。我想问一下，听说星期一就开始有暖气了，为什么我家的暖气一点儿都不热呢？\n物业：先生，是这样的，暖气管道有点儿问题，我们正在修。\n本：那什么时候可以修好？天气太冷了！\n物业：明天上午就可以了。\n本：好吧，谢谢，再见！\n物业：不客气，再见！",
    "traditional": "沒有暖氣？\n\n物業：喂，您好！這裡是物業，有什麼可以幫您嗎？\n本：您好，我是住在802的。我想問一下，聽說星期一就開始有暖氣了，為什麼我家的暖氣一點兒都不熱呢？\n物業：先生，是這樣的，暖氣管道有點兒問題，我們正在修。\n本：那什麼時候可以修好？天氣太冷了！\n物業：明天上午就可以了。\n本：好吧，謝謝，再見！\n物業：不客氣，再見！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "No heating?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "物业：喂，您好！这里是物业，有什么可以帮您吗？",
      "traditional": "物業：喂，您好！這裡是物業，有什麼可以幫您嗎？",
      "pinyin": "wù yè wéi nín hǎo zhè lǐ shì wù yè yǒu shén me kě yǐ bāng nín ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Property Management: Hello! This is property management. Is there anything I can help you with?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：您好，我是住在802的。",
      "traditional": "本：您好，我是住在802的。",
      "pinyin": "běn nín hǎo wǒ shì zhù zài 3 de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我想问一下，听说星期一就开始有暖气了，为什么我家的暖气一点儿都不热呢？",
      "traditional": "我想問一下，聽說星期一就開始有暖氣了，為什麼我家的暖氣一點兒都不熱呢？",
      "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng wèn yí xià tīng shuō xīng qī yī jiù kāi shǐ yǒu nuǎn qì le wèi shén me wǒ jiā de nuǎn qì yì diǎn'r dōu bú rè ne",
      "english": "Ben: Hello, I live in 802."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I wanted to ask, I heard that we had heating starting on Monday. Why is the heat in my apartment not warm at all?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "物业：先生，是这样的，",
      "traditional": "物業：先生，是這樣的，",
      "pinyin": "wù yè xiān sheng shì zhè yàng de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "暖气管道有点儿问题，我们正在修。",
      "traditional": "暖氣管道有點兒問題，我們正在修。",
      "pinyin": "nuǎn qì guǎn dào yǒu diǎn'r wèn tí wǒ men zhèng zài xiū",
      "english": "Property Management: Sir, here’s what’s going on."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "There’s something wrong with the heating pipes; we’re fixing it right now."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：那什么时候可以修好？天气太冷了！",
      "traditional": "本：那什麼時候可以修好？天氣太冷了！",
      "pinyin": "běn nà shén me shí hou kě yǐ xiū hǎo tiān qì tài lěng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Then when will it be fixed? It’s too cold!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "物业：明天上午就可以了。",
      "traditional": "物業：明天上午就可以了。",
      "pinyin": "wù yè míng tiān shàng wǔ jiù kě yǐ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Property Management: It’ll be fixed tomorrow morning."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "本：好吧，谢谢，再见！",
      "traditional": "本：好吧，謝謝，再見！",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo ba xiè xie zài jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Alright, thank you. Goodbye!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "物业：不客气，再见！",
      "traditional": "物業：不客氣，再見！",
      "pinyin": "wù yè bú kè qi zài jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Property Management: You’re welcome. Goodbye!"
    }
  ],
